	(text "Car path: F1 -> Z1 -> Q1/U1 ideal diode -> PPTRACKER -> J2. Signal pins pass straight through J1 -> J2.\nPPTRACKER: 12-14.5 V from the car, ~9 V from VBOOST via D2 on backup.\nParked drain from VCAR: the 7.7 M sense divider, ~1.6 uA. U1 floats: no ground pin, no quiescent current.\nJ1/J2 (v3.4): 1 SPARE, 2 GND, 3 CAN_H/K, 4 power, 5 IGN, 6 CAN_L/L."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.765 87.63 0)
		(effects
